  "prefLabel": "Plc 1502.14 Licensing bureau",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1502.14 “Licensing bureau” means the organizational unit within the OPLC’s division of licensing and board administration that is responsible for accepting and processing applications.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 1500) #13496, INTERIM, eff 11-27-22; ss by #13621, eff 5-22-23 (formerly Plc 1502.13) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 1500)",
